Well, the endgame bug I posted about earlier >IS< reproducable.  At least on
my machine, whenever you go upstairs from the first level, when the color is
on and the option COLOR is turned on, the game crashes (something, possibly,
to do with "GETICON"?)  Anyway, if, before I go up the stairs, I turn off
both my color (using switch-a-roo or the control panel), AND turn off the
color option in the options menu.  Nothing I have done, including switching
system versions and not using any inits/cdevs/fkeys, worked except for this.
Interestingly enough, when you have gone up the stairs and are on level 0 
you can safely turn both the machine color and the option color back on.  I
hope this is fixed in patch 8, although I won't have to worry about it.  With-
out cheating, I won't be getting that far for quite a while...

